# 🤖 Cursor & Codex Directives: Obsidian WorkOS

Always follow the universal directives in `AGENTS.md`.

## 📌 Golden Directives
- **MCP Tools**: Use the standard `workos_*` tools from `obsidian-workos-agent-suite`.
- **YAML Frontmatter**: Keep all frontmatter strictly compliant with `.schemas/*.schema.json`.
- **Concurrency**: Set `agent_state: processing` with `locked_by: "agent:codex"` while modifying existing files. Set `review_status: pending` when done.
- **Atomic Commits**: Bundle completed turns into descriptive commits on `main`.
